{"h":3395,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.12735408026406722,"w":0.11360459645589191,"y":0.10238843385935914,"h":0.01760685317507904},{"c":1,"y":0.14965583300415286,"h":0.0088278688446511433,"x":0.13167111892767275,"w":0.057645416259765631,"t":"GRAHAM:"},{"w":0.049382715225219725,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"x":0.12962963040179343,"y":0.16279069795499312,"t":"CATHY:"},{"h":0.0089196305112085872,"t":"GRAHAM.","x":0.13165846229604819,"y":0.20774948705459839,"w":0.05972834269205729,"c":1},{"x":0.1316021119994385,"w":0.047495365142822266,"t":"CATHY:","h":0.010576853622957794,"y":0.23526389863989694,"c":1},{"y":0.24991395991136089,"x":0.13166228337613159,"c":1,"t":"GRAHAM:","h":0.0088930101922600757,"w":0.059720700581868486},{"y":0.27906976732620503,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"t":"CATHY:","x":0.13168724289170253,"w":0.047325102488199849},{"w":0.46296295166015622,"c":1,"t":"No, it's entirely up to us. I suggest just using Charles Dickens.","y":0.14680232544728611,"h":0.014563987898180697,"x":0.22016461459460138},{"t":"That's a good idea. Most people have heard of him, and have probably read","w":0.57415888468424481,"x":0.21806117428220054,"y":0.15984059556097396,"c":1,"h":0.01623133579609104},{"y":0.17432273273589394,"w":0.59053497314453118,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.22016461234813864,"t":"some of his novels, or seen films based on them, so that's a good lead-in to life","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.21790572449925874,"t":"in his time.","y":0.18985389963180044,"w":0.086978791554768869,"h":0.013335807584621051},{"c":1,"w":0.60709177652994795,"h":0.015028597468902949,"y":0.20319664203507326,"t":"Exactly. And his novels show the awful conditions that most people had to live in,","x":0.22010844652840869},{"h":0.014839735693869871,"t":"don't they: he wanted to shock people into doing something about it.","x":0.22009173946190175,"y":0.21797143260702634,"c":1,"w":0.50835912068684896},{"c":1,"t":"Did he do any campaigning, other than writing?","y":0.23255813937267089,"w":0.35390945434570314,"x":0.22016461495454148,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"h":0.015352796188372375,"t":"Yes, he campaigned for education and other social reforms, and gave talks, but","x":0.22214954383569438,"y":0.24639920188294884,"w":0.59274424235026035,"c":1},{"x":0.22016461051930847,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312216,"w":0.37860081990559902,"y":0.26295641953565929,"t":"I'm inclined to ignore that and focus on the novels."},{"w":0.09692380905151371,"y":0.27720542838913975,"h":0.01390309609007645,"t":"Yes, I agree.","c":1,"x":0.22211422693071492},{"h":0.010628605899878241,"x":0.13158701468853123,"y":0.31517988307333544,"w":0.045467945734659843,"t":"CATHY:","c":1},{"w":0.059670778910319022,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"t":"GRAHAM:","y":0.3299418603711739,"x":0.13168724418314151,"c":1},{"y":0.35901162777720652,"w":0.049382715225219725,"t":"CATHY:","x":0.12962962993435739,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"t":"GRAHAM:","x":0.13159636168393068,"y":0.40088019561193833,"c":1,"h":0.010739608423167901,"w":0.061910158793131498},{"y":0.44615608449433941,"w":0.047372665405273434,"h":0.0088506216716429664,"c":1,"x":0.13166346143306237,"t":"CATHY:"},{"t":"GRAHAM.","y":0.47524774320276031,"w":0.061752599080403647,"h":0.0088068391465185858,"c":1,"x":0.13167514068617636},{"w":0.047501850128173817,"c":1,"t":"CATHY:","y":0.50269794489589581,"x":0.13159886845148042,"h":0.010592481974858958},{"x":0.13370774353019071,"t":"GRAHAM:","y":0.54640190638806718,"w":0.05974500656127929,"h":0.010393861606629362,"c":1},{"h":0.0089804595435044599,"y":0.56091674695110327,"x":0.13164195946742019,"t":"CATHY:","w":0.049473282496134446,"c":1},{"h":0.010312868933795571,"y":0.57551217016650014,"w":0.061773827870686832,"t":"GRAHAM:","x":0.13166452629462105,"c":1},{"t":"CATHY:","x":0.12958687217117515,"w":0.051525843938191734,"h":0.010392310341339583,"c":1,"y":0.61907710062166954},{"t":"GRAHAM:","x":0.13161816500332885,"h":0.010601143674097813,"y":0.63350756768159033,"w":0.06186655044555664,"c":1},{"x":0.13163967224788142,"t":"CATHY:","y":0.64811939574330146,"h":0.0089937666139277006,"c":1,"w":0.049477856953938804},{"t":"GRAHAM:","y":0.67537502975892016,"x":0.12945532839438362,"w":0.064134610493977867,"h":0.01262203346854518,"c":1},{"x":0.12956866630843925,"w":0.04950464248657227,"h":0.010473753453985934,"c":1,"y":0.70479219301670171,"t":"CATHY:"},{"t":"GRAHAM:","x":0.12962962827088156,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.71947674406150608,"w":0.06378601074218751,"c":1},{"t":"CATHY:","h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.73401162779242235,"c":1,"x":0.12962963015000631,"w":0.051440327962239574},{"x":0.13168724281321081,"c":1,"w":0.061728394826253252,"t":"GRAHAM:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.80668604638775587},{"w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.1337448560557504,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.82122093013436881,"c":1,"t":"CATHY:"},{"t":"GRAHAM:","x":0.13163095695525062,"h":0.010520813743133073,"w":0.061840966542561854,"c":1,"y":0.85011750008764297},{"h":0.0094951555501445739,"c":1,"y":0.86443846871850571,"t":"CATHY:","x":0.13360784802391834,"w":0.047599118550618491},{"h":0.014157754653193799,"y":0.31157412489146552,"x":0.22214613266916161,"w":0.45697987874348955,"c":1,"t":"OK, so now shall we think about a topic linked to each novel?"},{"h":0.016263733763857702,"x":0.22009945375097686,"c":1,"w":0.60506952921549484,"t":"Yes. I've printed out a list of Dickens's novels in the order they were published, in","y":0.32552869519005134},{"x":0.21796699261830932,"y":0.34071118454489735,"t":"the hope you'd agree to focus on him!","w":0.29045417785644534,"c":1,"h":0.016499395224455538},{"x":0.22007521101960112,"y":0.35400347428805734,"c":1,"w":0.54957219441731764,"h":0.017220512857425874,"t":"You're lucky I did agree! Let's have a look. OK, the first was The Pickwick"},{"w":0.57629185994466148,"y":0.36909117006175129,"x":0.2200854288803987,"c":1,"h":0.016433756258799392,"t":"Papers, published in 1836. It was very successful when it came out, wasn't it,"},{"x":0.22016461561575676,"t":"and was adapted for the theatre straight away.","w":0.34773661295572922,"h":0.013096802647459271,"c":1,"y":0.38515901069841973},{"t":"There's an interesting point, though, that there's a character who keeps falling","h":0.017942626288136587,"y":0.39709321592363112,"c":1,"w":0.58045206705729169,"x":0.22006732757721892},{"t":"asleep, and that medical condition was named after the book - Pickwickian.","w":0.56584360758463537,"y":0.41279069753563769,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.2201646160474659},{"x":0.2201114600960235,"c":1,"w":0.086526050567626966,"t":"Syndrome.","y":0.43003212239847333,"h":0.012028778399679751},{"x":0.22212017394239106,"y":0.44136311418421714,"h":0.017968279453272951,"w":0.5989788818359375,"c":1,"t":"On, so why don't we use that as the topic, and include some quotations from the"},{"c":1,"t":"novel?","w":0.054885203043619768,"x":0.21946166851578502,"h":0.014041666990174617,"y":0.45723058736174016},{"y":0.47000429897537388,"t":"Right. Next is Oliver Twist. There's a lot in the novel about poverty. But maybe","w":0.58038604736328125,"h":0.016987216486666901,"c":1,"x":0.22215429023607403},{"t":"something less obvious ...","x":0.22200179868364786,"h":0.015418588483291473,"w":0.19994836171468097,"y":0.48551645628289875,"c":1},{"y":0.49856635069985944,"c":1,"x":0.22008128073747799,"w":0.60717432657877601,"h":0.017176247317041149,"t":"Well Oliver is taught how to steal, isn't he? We could use that to illustrate the fact"},{"c":1,"w":0.60905349731445313,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.51442873985864679,"x":0.22016460936607454,"t":"that very few children went to school, particularly not poor children, so they learnt"},{"w":0.1028806559244792,"y":0.5305232556752616,"t":"in other ways.","x":0.22222222317549939,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.54348250552174782,"x":0.22204901091818205,"t":"Good idea. What's next?","h":0.015392000739790634,"c":1,"w":0.18759965260823566},{"c":1,"t":"Maybe Nicholas Nickleby. Actually he taught in a really cruel school, didn't he?","x":0.22007215587204768,"w":0.58867380777994793,"h":0.017432614406230784,"y":0.5566233536873707},{"t":"That's right. But there's also the company of touring actors that Nicholas joins.","y":0.57161982528619559,"x":0.22009282514947642,"h":0.015888328687041042,"w":0.58448781331380206,"c":1},{"x":0.22007275963398928,"h":0.017324048863423203,"c":1,"y":0.58515096156015756,"t":"We could do something on theatres and other amusements of the time. We don't","w":0.60513483683268232},{"c":1,"x":0.22002366412396829,"y":0.60165698444113125,"w":0.24931213378906253,"t":"want only the bad things, do we?","h":0.015973405647053185},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.028806584676106806,"y":0.61773255799351445,"t":"Ok.","c":1,"x":0.22222222196235814},{"x":0.22004378274178768,"y":0.6285800779611258,"c":1,"w":0.48794748942057287,"h":0.018571633472599935,"t":"What about Martin Chuzzlewit? He goes to the USA, doesn't he?"},{"h":0.016180067096076667,"x":0.22215636260916891,"t":"Yes, and Dickens himself had been there a year before, and drew on his","w":0.54537460327148435,"c":1,"y":0.6438082567885679},{"x":0.22222222202696382,"w":0.22427983601888021,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"experience there in the novel.","y":0.65988372076236568},{"x":0.22422202244883985,"y":0.67249676755123811,"w":0.60506373087565113,"t":"I wonder, though... The main theme is selfishness, so we could do something on","c":1,"h":0.015485323781259552},{"t":"social justice? No, too general, let's keep to your idea - I think it would work well.","y":0.68690464159434605,"h":0.015559152663807141,"c":1,"x":0.22216682197009466,"w":0.6070965576171875},{"c":1,"x":0.22427982415232889,"t":"He wrote Bleak House next - that's my favourite of his novels.","h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.70200235587778692,"w":0.46502059936523438},{"t":"Yes, mine too. His satire of the legal system is pretty powerful.","y":0.71646705703367086,"x":0.22215427951320388,"w":0.46720448811848958,"h":0.016214391508428183,"c":1},{"y":0.73039264343225585,"c":1,"t":"That's true, but think about Esther, the heroine. As a child she lives with someone","h":0.017015955894658985,"x":0.22213906380008061,"w":0.60716979980468744},{"y":0.74435500813120947,"c":1,"t":"she doesn't know is her aunt, who treats her very badly. Then she's very happy","x":0.22010769466734759,"w":0.59680821736653644,"h":0.015850081741458855},{"x":0.2221342014762564,"t":"living with her guardian, and he puts her in charge of the household. And at the","h":0.015755033324548307,"w":0.59069747924804683,"c":1,"y":0.75939725725902807},{"w":0.57012425740559891,"t":"end she gets married and her guardian gives her and her husband a house,","x":0.22211993014558781,"y":0.77354142348410349,"h":0.016719219962615495,"c":1},{"x":0.22222222697015079,"y":0.79063604267088972,"w":0.27366254170735682,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"where of course they're very happy.","c":1},{"t":"Yes, I like that.","y":0.80512330499806128,"w":0.11322455088297526,"c":1,"x":0.22219430881573946,"h":0.014753389976330689},{"t":"What shall we take next? Little Dorrit? Old Mr Dorrit has been in a debtors' prison","x":0.22222224595148513,"h":0.016024323318535427,"w":0.60699584960937503,"y":0.81537102490085045,"c":1},{"w":0.084857279459635421,"y":0.83509455390265819,"x":0.22396281000403193,"c":1,"t":"for years ..","h":0.011337703754258799},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.22427983206926957,"t":"So was Dickens's father, wasn't he?","w":0.27160494486490883,"y":0.84738372078979651},{"h":0.015415607829818545,"y":0.86135606841471357,"x":0.22375260663353316,"c":1,"w":0.089460500081380206,"t":"That's right."},{"w":0.072016461690266986,"x":0.83950617248134107,"y":0.15843023239698117,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q23\/Q24","c":1},{"y":0.20131871011445923,"w":0.072510999043782554,"c":1,"h":0.014513742516543471,"t":"Q23\/Q24","x":0.84131651685805875},{"y":0.39680232539116722,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q25","x":0.86008230498302851},{"y":0.51308139519040408,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.86008230492087134,"t":"Q26","w":0.034979422887166378},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.57122093007652963,"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.8600823049144416,"c":1,"t":"Q27"},{"y":0.64389534869637999,"t":"Q28","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.86008230492087134},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.86213991808316581,"t":"Q29","y":0.72965116264744578,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"c":1,"t":"104","w":0.03497942288716635,"x":0.13374485634834068,"y":0.92151162774854367,"h":0.013081395583944611}],"w":2400}